#6739
Watering Hole~
   This secluded pool appears to have been hidden by nature as there was no
indication of its existence when viewed from afar. The water is warm and
murky, but offers sustenance against the arid surroundings.
   A tree, no higher than you are tall, sprouts from the far edge of the pool,
its leafy green limbs contrasting nicely with the yellow reeds of the savanna.
~
